e_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128458" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 20\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128458" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 20\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Differentiate $f(t)+4g(t)$ with respect to $t$, given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨\\sqrt{t},\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,\\,2⟩ \\\\ g(t) & =⟨t,\\,\\frac{1}{t},\\,{t}^{4}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the constant multiple rule and the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(f(t)+4g(t))^{′}={f}^{′}(t)+4{g}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\sqrt{t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{1}{t},\\,0⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{4})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,4{t}^{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(t)+4g(t))^{′} & ={f}^{′}(t)+4{g}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{1}{t},\\,0⟩+4⟨1,\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,4{t}^{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{1}{t},\\,0⟩+⟨4,\\,-\\frac{4}{{t}^{2}},\\,16{t}^{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}+4,\\,\\frac{1}{t}-\\frac{4}{{t}^{2}},\\,0+16{t}^{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1+8\\sqrt{t}}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{t-4}{{t}^{2}},\\,16{t}^{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e765ed6ca51892a692aaca1144141d35f40653eddb185731c2f43172d515fb83" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨2\\sqrt{t},\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}+1}{t},\\,2{t}^{4}⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨4\\sqrt{t},\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,8t⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\frac{1+8\\sqrt{t}}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{t-4}{{t}^{2}},\\,16{t}^{3}⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\frac{1+\\sqrt{t}}{\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{1}{t},\\,16{t}^{4}⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70681" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{t}},\\,\\frac{t-4}{{t}^{2}},\\,4{t}^{3}⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128452" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the value of $(2f(t)-g(t))^{′}$ at $t=-1,$ if \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨8\\sqrt{3-t},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t),\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2t)⟩, \\\\ g(t) & =⟨{t}^{2}-t,\\,\\pi {t}^{2},\\,1-{t}^{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128452" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, notice that\n\n$$\n(2f(t)-g(t))^{′}=2{f}^{′}(t)-{g}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(8\\sqrt{3-t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi t)),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2t))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3-t}},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi t),\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}-t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\pi {t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-{t}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2t-1,\\,2\\pi t,\\,-2t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(2f(-1)-g(-1))^{′} & =2{f}^{′}(-1)-{g}^{′}(-1) \\\\  & =2⟨-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3-(-1)}},\\,\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡(-\\pi ),\\,\\frac{1}{(-1)}⟩-⟨2(-1)-1,\\,2\\pi (-1),\\,-2(-1)⟩ \\\\  & =2⟨-2,-\\pi ,-1⟩-⟨-3,-2\\pi ,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,-2\\pi ,-2⟩-⟨-3,-2\\pi ,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,0,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128452" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e765ed6ca51892a692aaca1144141d35f40653eddb185731c2f43172d515fb83" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Differentiate $f(t)+g(t)$ with respect to $t$, given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨1-2t,\\,{t}^{2},\\,(t-1)^{2}⟩, \\\\ g(t) & =⟨t+1,\\,1-2t,\\,{t}^{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "By the sum rule, we have\n\n$$\n(f(t)+g(t))^{′}={f}^{′}(t)+{g}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find the derivatives of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}((t-1)^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,2t,\\,2(t-1)⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{3})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-2,\\,3{t}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(t)+g(t))^{′} & ={f}^{′}(t)+{g}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,2t,\\,2t-2⟩+⟨1,\\,-2,\\,3{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2t-2,\\,3{t}^{2}+2t-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e765ed6ca51892a692aaca1144141d35f40653eddb185731c2f43172d515fb83" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-1,\\,2t,\\,{t}^{2}⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-1,\\,2t-2,\\,3{t}^{2}+2t-2⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-1,\\,2t-2,\\,3{t}^{2}⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-2,\\,-2t,\\,2t-2⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-127998" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-3,\\,2t+1,\\,3{t}^{2}+2t⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-32503" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Differentiate $f(t)+g(t)+h(t)$ with respect to $t$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨-1,\\,0,\\,1⟩ \\\\ g(t) & =⟨-t,\\,0,t⟩ \\\\ h(t) & =⟨-{t}^{2},0,{t}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-32503" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the sum rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(f(t)+g(t)+h(t))^{′}={f}^{′}(t)+{g}^{′}(t)+{h}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(0),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,0,0⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(0),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,0,1⟩ \\\\ {h}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-{t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(0),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2t,\\,0,\\,2t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(t)+g(t)+h(t))^{′} & ={f}^{′}(t)+{g}^{′}(t)+{h}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =⟨0,0,0⟩+⟨-1,0,1⟩+⟨-2t,\\,0,\\,2t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2t-1,\\,0,\\,2t+1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-32503" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e765ed6ca51892a692aaca1144141d35f40653eddb185731c2f43172d515fb83" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-32503" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" 