e, we can write\n\n$$\n{(u(t)f(t))}^{′}={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${f}^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4t-1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3t+2) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(5t+6)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t-3)=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u(t)f(t))}^{′} & ={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =2[\\begin{aligned}4t-1 \\\\ 3t+2 \\\\ 5t+6\\end{aligned}]+(2t-3)[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8t-2 \\\\ 6t+4 \\\\ 10t+12\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}8t-12 \\\\ 6t-9 \\\\ 10t-15\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}16t-14 \\\\ 12t-5 \\\\ 20t-3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/state.json" "file_sha256" "02aba40fc50cf16c9ab6e00205fba03003ccabb09c25850b4f5a62f5f60ac5a6" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71225" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e765ed6ca51892a692aaca1144141d35f40653eddb185731c2f43172d515fb83" "basis" 1410 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14039776/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-71225" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differenti